==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s (200%) spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Metal Doge]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Metal Doge]]s (200%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The stage provides you with very little to work with before the base hit, so you can use that time to build up your wallet.

When you hit the base, spam all of your anti-Metal CC units like [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Puppetmaster and Charley]] and your Critical Hitters like [[Catasaurus]] and [[Major Space Cat]] The minimal support in this level means that the Metal enemies will be quickly shredded.

